  "schema:identifier": "id-fc70dc8e3099419db5a0a81c81b5bf45",
  "schema:name": "Quality Analytics Engine",
  "schema:description": "This application component processes healthcare quality and operational data to generate insights, predictive analyses, trends, and performance evaluations. It supports advanced analytics for healthcare quality management and decision-making.\r\n\r\nThe purpose is to enable evidence-based quality improvement and supports proactive identification of healthcare risks and performance gaps. It also enhances reporting and strategic healthcare planning.\r\n\r\nExample: The analytics engine identifies hospitals with increasing readmission trends and predicts facilities at risk of performance decline.",
  "schema:category": "Application",
